  "slug": "sunflower-seed-and-basil-pesto",
  "name": "Sunflower Seed and Basil Pesto",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "Make this basil pesto recipe with sunflower seeds instead of pricey pine nuts and blend it just how you like \u2014 super smooth or a little bit chunky.",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine basil, parsley, olive oil, sunflower seeds, Pecorino Romano cheese, lemon juice, garlic, and sea salt in a small blender or food processor; pur\u00e9e until reaches desired consistency. Taste; adjust salt."
    }
